 end="00:23.104">own </span><span begin="00:23.535" end="00:24.303">little </span><span begin="00:24.527" end="00:25.801">cloud</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.960" end="00:30.207"><span begin="00:25.960" end="00:26.567">Up </span><span begin="00:26.567" end="00:27.048">by </span><span begin="00:27.048" end="00:27.559">the </span><span begin="00:27.559" end="00:29.135">milky </span><span begin="00:29.135" end="00:30.207">way</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.711" end="00:37.967"><span begin="00:30.711" end="00:31.311">I'll </span><span begin="00:31.311" end="00:31.687">stay </span><span begin="00:31.687" end="00:32.031">here </span><span begin="00:32.031" end="00:33.783">forever </span><span begin="00:33.783" end="00:34.511">and </span><span begin="00:34.511" end="00:35.152">a </span><span begin="00:35.152" end="00:37.967">day</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.807" end="00:46.815"><span begin="00:43.807" end="00:44.135">You </span><span begin="00:44.135" end="00:44.839">can't </span><span begin="00:44.839" end="00:45.191">pin </span><span begin="00:45.343" end="00:45.631">me </span><span begin="00:45.631" end="00:46.815">down</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.367" end="00:50.799"><span begin="00:47.367" end="00:47.759">I </span><span begin="00:47.759" end="00:48.391">fear </span><span begin="00:48.591" end="00:48.863">all </span><span begin="00:49.039" end="00:49.583">solid </span><span begin="00:49.951" end="00:50.799">ground</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.672" end="00:55.799"><span begin="00:51.672" end="00:51.889">I'd </span><span begin="00:52.079" end="00:52.575">rather </span><span begin="00:52.936" end="00:53.223">be </span><span begin="00:53.807" end="00:54.576">alone </span><span begin="00:54.823" end="00:55.111">at </span><span begin="00:55.111" end="00:55.799">tea</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.055" end="01:00.415"><span begin="00:56.055" end="00:56.839">Love </span><span begin="00:56.839" end="00:57.263">when </span><span begin="00:57.263" end="00:58.351">nobody's </span><span begin="00:58.351" end="00:58.959">makin' </span><span begin="00:58.959" end="00:59.607">me </span><span begin="00:59.791" end="01:00.415">oh</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.415" end="01:03.608"><span begin="01:00.415" end="01:00.791">Boys </span><span begin="01:00.791" end="01:01.248">just </span><span begin="01:01.248" end="01:01.623">make </span><span begin="01:01.623" end="01:02.063">me </span><span begin="01:02.063" end="01:03.608">cry</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.815" end="01:07.440"><span begin="01:03.815" end="01:04.415">Believe </span><span begin="01:04.656" end="01:04.967">me </span><span begin="01:05.193" end="01:05.679">I </span><span begin="01:05.679" end="01:06.079">have </span><span begin="01:06.079" end="01:07.440">tried</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.640" end="01:09.890"><span begin="01:07.640" end="01:08.217">I've </span><span begin="01:08.217" end="01:08.664">made </span><span begin="01:08.664" end="01:09.160">my </span><span begin="01:09.160" end="01:09.890">rounds</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.193" end="01:11.865"><span begin="01:10.193" end="01:10.592">Kissed </span><span begin="01:10.592" end="01:11.208">some </span><span begin="01:11.208" end="01:11.865">mouths</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.080" end="01:13.880"><span begin="01:12.080" end="01:12.440">Trust </span><span begin="01:12.440" end="01:12.856">me </span><span begin="01:12.856" end="01:13.200">I </span><span begin="01:13.200" end="01:13.512">don't </span><span begin="01:13.512" end="01:13.880">want</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.880" end="01:16.248"><span begin="01:13.880" end="01:14.160">A </span><span begin="01:14.160" end="01:14.394">single </span><span begin="01:14.394" end="01:14.754">soul </span><span begin="01:14.754" end="01:15.680">around </span><span begin="01:15.816" end="01:16.248">oh</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.433" end="01:17.880"><span begin="01:16.433" end="01:16.848">I'm </span><span begin="01:16.848" end="01:17.448">giving </span><span begin="01:17.552" end="01:17.880">up</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.880" end="01:19.752"><span begin="01:17.880" end="01:18.145">I'm </span><span begin="01:18.145" end="01:18.528">throwing </span><span begin="01:18.689" end="01:19.049">in </span><span begin="01:19.049" end="01:19.361">my </span><span begin="01:19.361" end="01:19.752">hat</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.017" end="01:23.848"><span begin="01:20.017" end="01:20.336">I </span><span begin="01:20.336" end="01:20.800">can't </span><span begin="01:20.800" end="01:21.177">take </span><span begin="01:21.177" end="01:21.816">another </span><span begin="01:22.040" end="01:22.648">lifeless </span><span begin="01:22.872" end="01:23.312">little </span><span begin="01:23.312" end="01:23.848">chat</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.017" end="01:31.808"><span begin="01:24.017" end="01:24.368">I'm </span><span begin="01:24.368" end="01:24.929">moving </span><span begin="01:25.304" end="01:25.616">up </span><span begin="01:25.760" end="01:26.089">into </span><span begin="01:26.240" end="01:26.777">a </span><span begin="01:26.777" end="01:27.345">cloud </span><span begin="01:27.345" end="01:27.850">into </span><span begin="01:27.850" end="01:28.281">my </span><span begin="01:28.281" end="01:31.808">fantasy</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.808" end="01:36.513"><span begin="01:31.808" end="01:32.232">And </span><span begin="01:32.440" end="01:32.728">no </span><span begin="01:32.928" end="01:33.265">boy's </span><span begin="01:33.265" end="01:33.768">gonna </span><span begin="01:33.960" end="01:34.425">be </span><span begin="01:34.425" end="01:34.880">so </span><span begin="01:34.880" end="01:35.352">smart </span><span begin="01:35.545" end="01:35.969">as </span><span begin="01:35.969" end="01:36.513">to</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.513" end="01:39.520"><span beg