b </span><span begin="02:21.867" end="02:22.139">to </span><span begin="02:22.139" end="02:22.523">love </span><span begin="02:22.939" end="02:23.179">oh</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.674" end="02:24.723"><span begin="02:23.674" end="02:23.916">I'm </span><span begin="02:23.916" end="02:24.475">giving </span><span begin="02:24.475" end="02:24.723">up</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.891" end="02:26.763"><span begin="02:24.891" end="02:25.179">I'm </span><span begin="02:25.179" end="02:25.603">throwing </span><span begin="02:25.603" end="02:25.899">in </span><span begin="02:25.899" end="02:26.363">my </span><span begin="02:26.363" end="02:26.763">hat</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.931" end="02:30.699"><span begin="02:26.931" end="02:27.242">I </span><span begin="02:27.435" end="02:27.707">can't </span><span begin="02:27.883" end="02:28.099">take </span><span begin="02:28.258" end="02:28.506">another </span><span begin="02:29.043" end="02:29.619">lifeless </span><span begin="02:29.820" end="02:30.163">little </span><span begin="02:30.363" end="02:30.699">chat</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.859" end="02:38.491"><span begin="02:30.859" end="02:31.163">I'm </span><span begin="02:31.371" end="02:31.835">moving </span><span begin="02:32.219" end="02:32.451">up </span><span begin="02:32.627" end="02:32.995">into </span><span begin="02:33.227" end="02:33.587">a </span><span begin="02:33.587" end="02:33.891">cloud </span><span begin="02:34.195" end="02:34.571">into </span><span begin="02:34.771" end="02:35.043">my </span><span begin="02:35.475" end="02:38.491">fantasy</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.491" end="02:43.234"><span begin="02:38.491" end="02:39.051">And </span><span begin="02:39.243" end="02:39.547">no </span><span begin="02:39.547" end="02:39.924">boy's </span><span begin="02:39.924" end="02:40.531">gonna </span><span begin="02:40.787" end="02:41.235">be </span><span begin="02:41.235" end="02:41.723">so </span><span b